#: includes/abilities/class-videos-abilities.php:219
msgid "Restore a trashed VidShop video"
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/class-videos-abilities.php:220
msgid "Restores a video from the trash and returns it to draft status, clearing the deletion stamp. This is the undo half of vidshop/trash-video. It fails if the video is not currently in the trash."
msgstr ""

#: includes/abilities/class-videos-abilities.php:228
msgid "The VidShop video row ID to restore. List trashed videos with vidshop/list-videos using status \"trash\"."
msgstr ""

